
## `.gitignore`

For your project, I'd use:

```gitignore
# Build output
build/*

# Keep the build directory
!build/.gitkeep

# Raylib generated build files
external/raylib/build/

# Compiled object files
*.o
*.obj

# Executables
*.exe
*.out

# Debugging
*.log
core
core.*

# IDE / editor files
.vscode/
.idea/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.swp
*~
